E-Pad Reset
===========

A modified version of tekware-it/android-epson-reset, which is itself a port of
CiRIP/ez-reset. This file states what the work is, what was changed, and under
which licence it is distributed.

This file is here because AGPL-3.0 section 5 asks a modified work to carry
prominent notices that it was modified, with a relevant date, and that it is
released under the licence. The notices live here rather than in a header on
every source file: a header added to files that were otherwise untouched would
attribute every one of their lines to the change that added the header, which
would erase exactly the record this notice exists to state.


